{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone","id":1150044,"title":"Portable Reality Zone?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-15T18:29:45-07:00","id":1150044,"title":"Portable Reality Zone?","content":"So, public perception of events has an effect on the perceived reality of magic.<br /> <br /> What if a person deliberately cultivated a reputation for doing the impossible? For example a famous stage magician or what have you. Would they carry a reality zone with them? Presuming they made it known who they were and were believed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T00:03:11-07:00","id":1150093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone#post1150044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, public perception of events has an effect on the perceived reality of magic.<br /> <br /> What if a person deliberately cultivated a reputation for doing the impossible? For example a famous stage magician or what have you. Would they carry a reality zone with them? Presuming they made it known who they were and were believed?</div> </div> </div> </div>Kinda, but not completely.<br /> If they were doing street magic then it would have to be coincidental stuff, more stuff might be considered coincidental but only so much. Turning into an animal isn't a typical street magic thing, and would still be very vulgar.<br /> <br /> For that sort of stuff you'd probably need a big stage to help sell the illusion as plausibly possible through mundane means, and that means setting it up as such.<br /> <br /> Even then, unless you had an audience void of sceptics or other magicians who know what to look for, you're unlikely to get away with the really vulgar stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T08:56:21-07:00","id":1150157,"title":"","content":"I doubt a stage magician could reliably pull enough believers into one area. A televangelist might be able to draw tens of thousands of people into an auditorium though, and that might do something during the actual service. That's a product of the crowd, though, and it wouldn't follow the preacher when he was on a random street corner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-16T14:51:31-07:00","id":1150211,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1150093#post1150093\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Kinda, but not completely.<br /> If they were doing street magic then it would have to be coincidental stuff, more stuff might be considered coincidental but only so much. Turning into an animal isn't a typical street magic thing, and would still be very vulgar.<br /> <br /> For that sort of stuff you'd probably need a big stage to help sell the illusion as plausibly possible through mundane means, and that means setting it up as such.<br /> <br /> Even then, unless you had an audience void of sceptics or other magicians who know what to look for, you're unlikely to get away with the really vulgar stuff.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think a magician could turn themselves into an animal, if they used the right obfuscations. Like, putting himself in a box, then walking out a tiger. Or throwing smokebombs to the ground, and when it clears his clothes are on the floor, and a bird crawls from them and flies away. In the case of stage magic - whether on an actual stage or on the streets - what matters is how well you can convince the audience that you couldn't pulled a fast one on them.<br /> <br /> Because, of course, everyone knows that stage magic is all about misdirection and illusion. Everyone knows it's a trick. The challenge for stage magicians is in making the trick suitably spectacular, while making it as difficult as possible to figure out. The challenge for the audience is in them trying to guess after the fact how a magician could have pulled it off (and if they don't, then they can marvel at how awesome the spectacle was, and good was the magician).<br /> <br /> For a Mage magician, they have disbelief working in their favor, rather than against them. The audience is not just expecting that the fantastic things they see can't happen; they have a ready-made explanation for what they see. In this case, skeptics would actually reinforce the attempt at Blatancy, because almost as soon as the &quot;trick&quot; goes off, they are spinning possible &quot;rational&quot; explanations for it in their heads, and bouncing them off the incredulous audience members next to them. Again, the Disbelief of the skeptic ironically works in the mage magician's favor.<br /> <br /> But you are correct about other magicians, since they know the trade and could spot a trick that's just not possible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T05:17:09-07:00","id":1150304,"title":"","content":"I think your latching on to the stage magician thing and missing the point.<br /> <br /> I mean if a Mage just takes the hit on the nose when it comes to paradox and does magic in public frequently, to the point where people actually expect that from them. Aside from pissing off the paradox spirits and the Technocracy, would this have any effect?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T11:42:36-07:00","id":1150400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1150304#post1150304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think your latching on to the stage magician thing and missing the point.<br /> <br /> I mean if a Mage just takes the hit on the nose when it comes to paradox and does magic in public frequently, to the point where people actually expect that from them. Aside from pissing off the paradox spirits and the Technocracy, would this have any effect?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, that's not how reality zones work. Unless the guy creates some kind of cult, paradox isn't going to go away through reputation alone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T12:46:07-07:00","id":1151427,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1150400#post1150400\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sorry, that's not how reality zones work. Unless the guy creates some kind of cult, paradox isn't going to go away through reputation alone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Isn't that exactly what a Cult is? There's nothing mystical to a cult, it just represents people who believe that the mage is capable of the impossible. If they go to great lengths to make their name a household one for doing impossible things. To the point where their proverbial cult, is everyone...<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11744-enginseer-42","name":"Enginseer-42","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"774"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T15:20:59-07:00","id":1151490,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1151427#post1151427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Isn't that exactly what a Cult is? There's nothing mystical to a cult, it just represents people who believe that the mage is capable of the impossible. If they go to great lengths to make their name a household one for doing impossible things. To the point where their proverbial cult, is everyone...</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;There's nothing mystical about a cult&quot;. In reality that may be true, but in Mage, cult like devotion to a belief is exactly what creates things like paradigm.<br /> <br /> Yes, in theory you could make a cult for everyone to believe, and to date there is one group of mages who has done that successfully. They are called the technocracy.<br /> <br /> If literally everyone believed you could do mystical things, it's no longer a reality zone, it's a consensus and thus as good as reality. Practically speaking hwoever, any consensus you make that doesn't fit in with the dominant Technocratic reality is a direct chalange to their authority, so expect a lot of resistance from them.<br /> To begin with you'll be dismissed, silenced by disinterest. Any attempt to asvertise yourself will be subtly brushed aside, websites will be burried, performances not reviewed, books unpublished, with self published titles gathering dust on store shelves.<br /> If somehow you do manage to make a name for yourself, then prepare to be taken down a bit more aggressively. Media coverage exposing you as a &quot;fraud&quot;, people coming out of the woodwork to speak out about how dangerous you are, archival footage linking you with bad activity, the odd out of context quotes dragging your integrity through the dirt.<br /> If somehow you survive that, then it will have to be direct conflict. That is, unless you can work with them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T09:41:52-07:00","id":1152533,"title":"","content":"The Magic Bus.<br /> <br /> No, not the cartoon, the thing from the Hippie era. People saw one of those and expected some strange things to happen. Even now, the image remains in the public subconscious. Not as effective now as it was in 1969, but a mage in that bus could probably lower their chances at a Paradox backlash while cruising around in it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-24T11:12:43-07:00","id":1152562,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1152533#post1152533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Magic Bus.<br /> <br /> No, not the cartoon, the thing from the Hippie era. People saw one of those and expected some strange things to happen. Even now, the image remains in the public subconscious. Not as effective now as it was in 1969, but a mage in that bus could probably lower their chances at a Paradox backlash while cruising around in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>As long as they only drive in places with populations who understood the cultural shorthand such a bus would have to generate.<br /> <br /> Driving such a thing in Shanghai, for example, probably wouldn't do you much good magic wise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-25T08:48:13-07:00","id":1152816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1152562#post1152562\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As long as they only drive in places with populations who understood the cultural shorthand such a bus would have to generate.<br /> <br /> Driving such a thing in Shanghai, for example, probably wouldn't do you much good magic wise.</div> </div> </div> </div>As always: location, location, location..... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-27T12:11:47-07:00","id":1153551,"title":"","content":"I can see two ways to do a portable Reality Zone:<br /> <br /> 1. Be a Marauder. Technically, this is a MRev thing that M20 dropped; but M20 is all about making the game yours, right? So the idea here is that a Marauder's Quiet is so powerful that <i>it</i> determines what the local Reality Zone is like, overriding the local inhabitants.<br /> <br /> 2. Surround yourself with a mobile community such as a carnival. If your followers are numbers enough and fervent enough, they might be enough to override the local Reality Zone for as long as you're in the proper \u201ccarnival atmosphere\u201d. (Isn't there a Background to this effect?)<br /> <br /> The business about being a stage magician is what the Blatancy ability is supposed to be about. Mind you, I'm not find of the ability; but there you are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-29T22:31:43-07:00","id":1154061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1153551#post1153551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2. Surround yourself with a mobile community such as a carnival. If your followers are numbers enough and fervent enough, they might be enough to override the local Reality Zone for as long as you're in the proper \u201ccarnival atmosphere\u201d. (Isn't there a Background to this effect?)</div> </div> </div> </div>There is, in fact, a Background that surrounds the Mage with followers who believe in - and therefore reinforce - her magick. It's called Cult.<br /> <br /> Although, by that token, you need to worry about Skeptics, the Adversarial Background that is Cult's opposite.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-30T01:17:05-07:00","id":1154071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Enginseer-42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone#post1150044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What if a person deliberately cultivated a reputation for doing the impossible? For example a famous stage magician or what have you. Would they carry a reality zone with them? Presuming they made it known who they were and were believed?</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't say that they would carry a reality zone with them. However, if they set up their usual equipment and tools, make a show, and there are enough persons that believe in the True Mage's reputation, then it could indeed be said that they would be able to work in a small reality zone that would - to a lesser or greater extent - benefit them in regards to casting True Magick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-31T18:37:12-07:00","id":1154572,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muad'Dib</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1150044-portable-reality-zone?p=1154071#post1154071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wouldn't say that they would carry a reality zone with them. However, if they set up their usual equipment and tools, make a show, and there are enough persons that believe in the True Mage's reputation, then it could indeed be said that they would be able to work in a small reality zone that would - to a lesser or greater extent - benefit them in regards to casting True Magick.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If they were setting up equipment and making a shoe about it, I'd argue they were performing an elaborate ritual, meaning effects that would otherwise be vulgar could become coincidental.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}